      "text": "CPI for all items increases 0.1% in July; shelter rises"
    },
    {
      "locator": "html:paragraph[2]",
      "text": "In July, the Consumer Price Index for All Urban Consumers rose 0.1 percent, seasonally"
    },
    {
      "locator": "html:paragraph[3]",
      "text": "adjusted (SA), and rose 3.4 percent over the last 12 months, not seasonally adjusted (NSA). The index for"
    },
    {
      "locator": "html:paragraph[4]",
      "text": "all items less food and energy rose 0.2 percent in July (SA); up 2.5 percent over the year (NSA)."
    },
